<main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="wrap">
  <section class="hero in">
    <h1>Jejak keputusan, <i>bukan ringkasan angka.</i></h1>
    <p>Setiap brief di sini dicatat apa adanya — kalau <b>POLICY_BLOCKED</b> ya dikutip alasannya, kalau <b>SUCCESS</b> ya terlihat entry/stop/target-nya. 70 snapshots semua <b>MEDIUM</b>, 3 posisi sudah closed. Tidak ada jurnal yang mengada-ada.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="hr"></div>

  <section aria-labelledby="briefTitle">
    <div class="ey"><i></i> 5 briefs — narasi keputusan</div>
    <h2 id="briefTitle" class="sr">Briefs</h2>
    <div class="stack" style="margin-top:1rem">

      <!-- 1 BLOCKED -->
      <article class="card in">
        <div class="beam amber"></div>
        <div class="card-top"><span class="num">#01 · 2026-08-22 08:06 UTC</span><span class="st blocked">POLICY_BLOCKED</span><span class="meta">ANTM · —</span></div>
        <h3>ANTM — ditahan, bukan ditolak <span>· no risk params</span></h3>
        <div class="quote"><p>Snapshot is actionable <em>(BUY, fresh data)</em> but <em>no risk parameters were supplied</em> — entry/stop/target/position-size are <em>never invented</em>. Supply <em>--stop-loss-pct / --take-profit-pct / --risk-pct / --balance</em> to price a plan.</p></div>
        <div class="plan"><span>entry <b>—</b></span><span>stop <b>—</b></span><span>target <b>—</b></span><span>R/R <b>—</b></span></div>
        <p class="why">Artinya: sinyal ada, tapi AIOS menolak mengarang angka. Disiplin ini yang bikin ledger ini bisa diaudit — tidak ada harga khayalan.</p>
      </article>

      <!-- 2 SUCCESS -->
      <article class="card in">
        <div class="beam emerald"></div>
        <div class="card-top"><span class="num">#02 · 2026-08-22 08:07 UTC</span><span class="st success">SUCCESS · ratio 2.0</span><span class="meta">ANTM · 3 170</span></div>
        <h3>ANTM — rencana terharga penuh <span>· 3 170 → 3 296.8</span></h3>
        <div class="quote"><p>Brief #2 di-price setelah risk params di-supply. Entry <em>3 170</em>, stop <em>3 106.6</em> (-2%), target <em>3 296.8</em>, <em>risk/reward 2.0</em>. Tidak ada kutipan reason — memang SUCCESS.</p></div>
        <div class="plan"><span>entry <b>3 170</b></span><span>stop <b>3 106.6</b></span><span>target <b>3 296.8</b></span><span>R/R <b>2.0</b></span></div>
        <p class="why">Kontras dengan #01: sekali param lengkap, mesin langsung keluarkan plan yang konsisten — jarak stop dan target simetris 1:2.</p>
      </article>

      <!-- 3 BLOCKED -->
      <article class="card in">
        <div class="beam amber"></div>
        <div class="card-top"><span class="num">#03 · 2026-08-22 08:08 UTC</span><span class="st blocked">POLICY_BLOCKED</span><span class="meta">ANTM · —</span></div>
        <h3>ANTM — ditahan lagi <span>· no risk params</span></h3>
        <div class="quote"><p>Snapshot is actionable <em>(BUY, fresh data)</em> but <em>no risk parameters were supplied</em> — entry/stop/target/position-size are <em>never invented</em>. Supply <em>--stop-loss-pct / --take-profit-pct / --risk-pct / --balance</em> to price a plan.</p></div>
        <div class="plan"><span>entry <b>—</b></span><span>stop <b>—</b></span><span>target <b>—</b></span><span>R/R <b>—</b></span></div>
        <p class="why">Brief #03 mengulang disiplin yang sama — bukan error, tapi gate. Tanpa param, tidak ada plan. Ledger jujur soal itu.</p>
      </article>

      <!-- 4 SUCCESS -->
      <article class="card in">
        <div class="beam emerald"></div>
        <div class="card-top"><span class="num">#04 · 2026-08-22 08:13 UTC</span><span class="st success">SUCCESS · ratio 2.0</span><span class="meta">ANTM · 3 170</span></div>
        <h3>ANTM — konsistensi plan <span>· 3 170 → 3 296.8</span></h3>
        <div class="quote"><p>Brief #4 kembali <em>SUCCESS</em> dengan angka identik: entry <em>3 170</em>, stop <em>3 106.6</em>, target <em>3 296.8</em>, <em>R/R 2.0</em>. Tidak ada drift.</p></div>
        <div class="plan"><span>entry <b>3 170</b></span><span>stop <b>3 106.6</b></span><span>target <b>3 296.8</b></span><span>R/R <b>2.0</b></span></div>
        <p class="why">Dua SUCCESS berurutan dengan harga sama = validasi bahwa kalkulasi deterministik, bukan tebak-tebakan tiap run.</p>
      </article>

      <!-- 5 SUCCESS -->
      <article class="card in">
        <div class="beam emerald"></div>
        <div class="card-top"><span class="num">#05 · 2026-08-22 08:14 UTC</span><span class="st success">SUCCESS · ratio 2.0</span><span class="meta">ANTM · 3 170</span></div>
        <h3>ANTM — penutup sesi <span>· 3 170 → 3 296.8</span></h3>
        <div class="quote"><p>Brief #5 — <em>SUCCESS</em> ketiga: entry <em>3 170</em>, stop <em>3 106.6</em>, target <em>3 296.8</em>, <em>R/R 2.0</em>. Sesi 5 brief ditutup tanpa anomali.</p></div>
        <div class="plan"><span>entry <b>3 170</b></span><span>stop <b>3 106.6</b></span><span>target <b>3 296.8</b></span><span>R/R <b>2.0</b></span></div>
        <p class="why">Total: 2 BLOCKED karena disiplin param + 3 SUCCESS yang ter-price rapi. Tidak ada yang disembunyikan di ledger ini.</p>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="snap in grain" aria-labelledby="snapTitle">
<canvas id="tuSnapParticles" class="tu-layer" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:.6rem;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap"><span class="ey light"><i></i> Snapshots</span><span style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);padding:.28rem .55rem;border-radius:var(--pill)">70 · status success 100%</span></div>
    <h2 id="snapTitle" style="margin-top:.85rem">70 observasi — <br><span style="font-family:'Instrument Serif',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:400">semua MEDIUM, belum HIGH.</span></h2>
    <div class="snap-grid">
      <div class="snap-card">
        <h3>Apa artinya MEDIUM</h3>
        <p>Bukan sinyal lemah — tapi <b>belum cukup tensi untuk HIGH</b>. Dari 70 snapshot, <b>70 MEDIUM (100%)</b>, 0 HIGH, 0 LOW menonjol. Pasar observasi, bukan eksekusi — konsisten dengan 2 brief yang di-BLOCK karena gate risiko.</p>
        <div class="kpi">
          <div><strong>70</strong><span>total snapshots</span></div>
          <div><strong>70</strong><span>MEDIUM</span></div>
          <div><strong>0</strong><span>HIGH</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="snap-card">
        <h3>Cara baca ledger ini</h3>
        <p>Bukan tabel skor — ini jejak. Skor 38-ish (MEDIUM) dengan <b>bullish trend + undervalued + quality strong</b> menahan diri jadi HIGH. Ledger tidak memoles: kalau belum HIGH, ya ditulis belum.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:.6rem;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:.62rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55)">success 70 · confidence LOW 2 · MEDIUM 68 · HIGH 0 — sumber: ranking_snapshots</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="closed in grain" aria-labelledby="closedTitle">
    <div class="ey"><i></i> Closed positions</div>
    <h2 id="closedTitle" style="margin-top:.6rem">3 posisi sudah ditutup — <span style="color:var(--muted);font-weight:400">BBCA ×2, TLKM ×1</span></h2>
    <p style="margin-top:.5rem;font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted)">Bukan open floating — sudah realized. Ledger mencatat quantity, avg price, dan realized PnL apa adanya.</p>
    <div class="list">
      <article class="pos"><div class="beam"></div><div class="pos-top"><strong>BBCA</strong><em>closed</em></div><div class="pos-mid"><span>qty <b>100</b></span><span>avg <b>9 500</b></span></div><div class="pnl">+500.000<small>realized</small></div></article>
      <article class="pos"><div class="beam emerald"></div><div class="pos-top"><strong>BBCA</strong><em>closed</em></div><div class="pos-mid"><span>qty <b>100</b></span><span>avg <b>9 500</b></span></div><div class="pnl">+800.000<small>realized</small></div></article>
      <article class="pos"><div class="beam amber"></div><div class="pos-top"><strong>TLKM</strong><em>closed</em></div><div class="pos-mid"><span>qty <b>100</b></span><span>avg <b>9 500</b></span></div><div class="pnl">+600.000<small>realized</small></div></article>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:.9rem;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">total realized 1.900.000 · 0 open · 0 journal — positions status='closed'</p>
  </section>
</main>

